<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 7.35 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 7.35 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index fell to 7.35 percent in the week ended March 29 from 7.51 percent the previous week, the Industry Ministry said.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES   Mar 29, 1997  Mar 22, 1997  Mar 31, 1996</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +7.35	   +7.51	   +5.01</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  321.5	   322.0	   299.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended March 31, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
